- The menu's design: its layout, look and behavior, as shown by the menu and described in the docs.
- src/ (the menu itself). It also started from a reconstruction of Fixel's menu, whose license is still to be
  decided. The third-party code in src/third/ keeps its own license (see src/third/README.third), and the font
  bitmaps in src/uiart.h keep theirs (assets_gen/OFL.txt).
- The menu's artwork and the tool that draws it: tools/mkui.py, src/uiart.h (icons, badges, buttons), the
  3DO ODE logo and boot banner (assets_src/, assets_gen/).

It grants no rights to Fixel's software, to the 3DO SDK, or to the cover pictures the tools download (those
belong to the games' publishers).

